ue">腰椎</button><button data-focus="neck">颈肩</button><button data-focus="knees">髋膝</button><button id="focusBody">看全身</button></div><p id="sceneExplanation" class="sceneExplanation"></p><div id="bodyAnalysis"></div><div class="durationPresets"><button data-minutes="0">0 分钟</button><button data-minutes="1">1 分钟</button><button data-minutes="10">10 分钟</button><button data-minutes="30">30 分钟</button><button data-minutes="60">60 分钟</button></div><div id="timeAnalysis"></div><section id="gravityObservation" aria-live="polite"></section><div class="gravityTools"><button id="gravityView">看重心与支撑</button><button id="segmentCenters" aria-pressed="false">显示分段质心</button></div><details><summary>参考分段参数与骨架对应</summary><div id="segmentTable"></div></details><details id="environment"><summary>改变观察条件</summary><div class="inputs"><label>身体质量 kg<input id="mass" type="number" min="20" max="200" value="70"></label><label id="loadLabel">物体质量 kg<input id="load" type="number" min="0" max="40" value="0"></label><label>持续分钟<input id="minutes" type="number" min="0" max="480" value="30"></label><label>计划换姿 / 换任务间隔（0为不安排）<input id="interval" type="number" min="0" max="120" value="20"></label></div><p id="loadContext" class="muted"></p><p id="loadNotice" role="status" class="muted"></p><label>重力 m/s²<input id="gravity" type="number" min="0" max="20" step=".01" value="9.81"></label><div class="environmentPresets"><button data-gravity="9.81">地球</button><button data-gravity="1.62">月球</button><button data-gravity="0">零重力</button></div><label id="waterRow" hidden>设定排水体积 L<input id="volume" type="number" min="0" max="200" value="65"></label><p id="inputError" role="alert"></p></details><details><summary>能算出的量与计算假设</summary><div id="numbers"></div></details><label class="comparePicker">对照生活场景<select id="compareChoice" aria-label="对照生活场景"></select></label><section id="comparison" hidden><h3>与上一个状态比较</h3><div id="comparisonBody"></div><button id="clearPin">清除对比</button></section><details><summary>依据与尚未求解的内容